/-! ###### elimination lemmas for the CPS leaf decoders (am-cert, 2026-10-14)

`mleafP_ok` used to expose the decoded values by `simp only [dec4RG, forceR_eq]`, which writes every decoded field as an
expression (the offsets chain through 34 decoders).  These lemmas instead introduce each decoded value as a variable:
a property `P` that follows from every nonzero continuation value follows from a nonzero decoder value. ###### -/

noncomputable section

namespace AMW.Cert.PCell

